{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1429473-nwo-operative-with-unique-philosophy-need-help-for-storytelling-this","id":1429473,"title":"NWO operative with unique philosophy. need help for storytelling this","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-12-22T00:33:24-08:00","id":1429473,"title":"NWO operative with unique philosophy. need help for storytelling this","content":"so im STing a technocracy game and one of my players is playing a follower of Plato and a bit of philosophical deviant within the union. <br /> <br /> he bellies in things like &quot;Jungian archetypal theory&quot;; the platonic prototypes manifesting in the ensemble space or astral umbra; the logos, pathos ethos Modes of persuasion. also the notion of <span style=\"color:#000000\"> <span style=\"font-family:GoudyOldStyleT\">Enlightened Anthropic Principle, the: </span><span style=\"font-family:GoudyOldStyleT\">Technocratic theory that human beings create the conditions of a human- based reality through conscious and subconscious accord; in short, the belief that people \u2013 especially Enlightened people \u2013 create and maintain reality as we know it.</span><br /> <br /> <br /> </span><br /> <br /> something he's really into, since he is a dimensional science and mind major. also employs correspondence, not necessarily data. <br /> <br /> <br /> \u200b<br /> this character is unique and could be deemed a bit of a deviant in the technocracy. im not sure if these ideas would be accepted and while I don't care, im down with retconning the union anyway, I want to know if anyone can provide some feedback on this idea for me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3148-zennis","name":"Zennis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-22T01:10:32-08:00","id":1429476,"title":"","content":"quotes from the PC<br /> <br /> &quot;The thing is that because the physical world is actually based on human consciousness and sub consciousness, the scientific method can be applied to the mind through the soft sciences/arts&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Of course, everything in the conscious mind comes from a foundation. So that's where the Mind Sphere comes in. Then it applies to dimensional science because Mind and the dimensional layers of reality are a reflection of each other&quot; <br /> <br /> &quot;apply the idea of Jungian archetypes and the collective unconsciousness and you see that the framework of who someone can become exists as a concept already...&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Anyone with a problem with Plato has a problem with 2500 years of foundation of human thought&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Everyone's already part of the technocracy, because the Technocracy is dedicated to Truth through the scientific method, and all knowable Truth is already known, it simply has to be rediscovered.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Anything that isn't priori knowledge is only opinion, which is the lowest of the low. The Traditions try to change reality by swaying Opinion, the Technocracy by a united humanity seeking Truth. The path is clear.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3148-zennis","name":"Zennis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-22T02:01:12-08:00","id":1429478,"title":"","content":"He would definitely be a maverick within the Technocracy and especially the NWO. Technocratic orthodoxy is based on scientific empiricism, which is the total opposite of the Platonic theory of the forms (and neoPlatonism, for that matter). He might feel drawn toward the Society of Ether, a Tradition based on a book (the Kitab al-Alacir) written by a Greek mage who may very well have studied at Plato\u2019s Academy and debated with Plato\u2019s student and rival Aristotle (whose philosophy is one of the foundations of the Technocratic Union).<br /> <br /> Hope this helps. Let me know if you have any specific questions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-22T03:58:55-08:00","id":1429487,"title":"","content":"He\u2019s also Into Aristotle more than Plato <br /> <br /> Should\u2019ve mentioned that","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3148-zennis","name":"Zennis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-22T04:16:27-08:00","id":1429489,"title":"","content":"The upcoming <b>Technocracy Reloaded</b> points out that Technocrats fully understand that what they do involves changing reality; what they <i>don't</i> acknowledge is that what they do is essentially the same as what the Superstitionists do. <br /> <br /> What <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3148-zennis\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3148_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3148\" data-vbnamecard=\"3148\">Zennis</a> describes actually fits in the Technocracy as described in TR.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-22T04:37:21-08:00","id":1429490,"title":"","content":"I'd look to the characters mentor - who put him on this path, and taught them the views they hold. Even without dots in mentor it would give the explanation of how they got to where they where.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26145-babi_gog","name":"babi_gog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26145_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"94"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-22T06:31:09-08:00","id":1429496,"title":"","content":"In a real sense, the Order of Reason would have been deeply committed to Plato and Aristotle. Heck, the Technocracy is founded by upperclass English people in the Victorian period. Those people were drenched in Plato and Aristotle. <br /> <br /> Your character would be seen as eccentric but useful for getting into the heads of Hermetics. Younger members of the Technocratic Union might come to him for insight into the history of the Union.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-22T06:46:23-08:00","id":1429498,"title":"","content":"Sounds like White Tower material. Enligthened Academics should know their classic philosophy.<br /> <br /> Probably the most &quot;eccentric &quot; part I see it's following Karl Jung. But it's not a big deal as long as you remain far away from the most mystical aspects of his theories (like the Red Book). And, yes, it can be used to explain mystical paradigms in a way more palatable to Technocratic views. The Technocracy isn't big on such syncretisms, but it's always going to be less of an outlier than &quot;psychics&quot; (and these do exist in the Union. So...I can see it)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-22T09:56:20-08:00","id":1429523,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1429473-nwo-operative-with-unique-philosophy-need-help-for-storytelling-this?p=1429489#post1429489\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The upcoming <b>Technocracy Reloaded</b> points out that Technocrats fully understand that what they do involves changing reality; what they <i>don't</i> acknowledge is that what they do is essentially the same as what the Superstitionists do. <br /> <br /> What <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> describes actually fits in the Technocracy as described in TR.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmmm. Good point.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-22T14:18:43-08:00","id":1429562,"title":"","content":"I don't see a problem. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1683_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1683\" data-vbnamecard=\"1683\">Aleph</a> is right to point out that the cannon Technos have a wide variety of stuff that is way out there.<br /> <br /> What matters more is the extent to which they challenge the underlying power structures of the Union. I mean, they sound like someone likely to have arguments with everyone; that's probably a much bigger issue.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-22T16:41:38-08:00","id":1429575,"title":"","content":"Not really. What was described is very much about seeking out truth rather than making your own truth.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-23T00:02:33-08:00","id":1429595,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zennis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1429473-nwo-operative-with-unique-philosophy-need-help-for-storytelling-this?p=1429487#post1429487\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">He\u2019s also Into Aristotle more than Plato <br /> <br /> Should\u2019ve mentioned that</div> </div> </div> </div>I think Aristotle is a better model for a Technocrat than Plato. Aristotle rejects the more mystical elements of Plato\u2019s theory of the forms in favor of searching for truth in the natural world around him.<br /> <br /> Not that you couldn\u2019t do a Technocrat who uses Plato as his inspiration. He would just be a lot more of a philosophical rebel than one who followed Aristotle would be.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-23T02:51:21-08:00","id":1429600,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">What matters more is the extent to which they challenge the underlying power structures of the Union. I mean, they sound like someone likely to have arguments with everyone; that's probably a much bigger issue.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1429473-nwo-operative-with-unique-philosophy-need-help-for-storytelling-this?p=1429575#post1429575\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not really. What was described is very much about seeking out truth rather than making your own truth.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Seeking out truth rather than making your own truth&quot; it's not exclusive to the Technocracy. More to the point, I have a hard time understanding how that it's related to any of the topics here.<br /> <br /> Most mystical practices seek out &quot;truth&quot; every bit as much as scientists, they just seek it in a non-scientific way. Heck, it's far easier to find <i>scientists </i>being postmodern and making their own truths - just go to the social sciences academy, there's quite a bit of them.<br /> <br /> Yet you don't see hard mystical practices in the Technocracy. And I would argue many social scientists with postmodern ideas (having a soft, functional, stance on truth) would be WAY more accepted in the NWO than one that believes objective truth that can be found meditating in the Bible.<br /> <br /> Technocracy isn't about &quot;finding truth&quot; any more than the Traditions are. The way you &quot;seek the truth&quot; can be polemical, and if you're going to be vocal about these methods of &quot;truth finding&quot;, you DO risk being Unmutual. Otherwise we would see Technocracy Reloaded being full of monks &quot;seeking the true nature of God and his design&quot; trough meditation, classic alchemists, and whatnot. They would just be a Traditions with a harder stance on Paradox.<br /> <br /> Now, I don't think this character it's going to be such an outlier - but I *have* to protest when someone seems to think a mindset about &quot;seeking out truth&quot; implies a character it's going to be more accpeted in the Technocracy, because that's bullshit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1683,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","user":"Aleph","date":". 12-23-2020, 05:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-23T06:35:14-08:00","id":1429620,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aleph</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1429473-nwo-operative-with-unique-philosophy-need-help-for-storytelling-this?p=1429600#post1429600\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> &quot;Seeking out truth rather than making your own truth&quot; it's not exclusive to the Technocracy. More to the point, I have a hard time understanding how that it's related to any of the topics here.<br /> <br /> Most mystical practices seek out &quot;truth&quot; every bit as much as scientists, they just seek it in a non-scientific way. Heck, it's far easier to find <i>scientists </i>being postmodern and making their own truths - just go to the social sciences academy, there's quite a bit of them.<br /> <br /> Yet you don't see hard mystical practices in the Technocracy. And I would argue many social scientists with postmodern ideas (having a soft, functional, stance on truth) would be WAY more accepted in the NWO than one that believes objective truth that can be found meditating in the Bible.<br /> <br /> Technocracy isn't about &quot;finding truth&quot; any more than the Traditions are. The way you &quot;seek the truth&quot; can be polemical, and if you're going to be vocal about these methods of &quot;truth finding&quot;, you DO risk being Unmutual. Otherwise we would see Technocracy Reloaded being full of monks &quot;seeking the true nature of God and his design&quot; trough meditation, classic alchemists, and whatnot. They would just be a Traditions with a harder stance on Paradox.<br /> <br /> Now, I don't think this character it's going to be such an outlier - but I *have* to protest when someone seems to think a mindset about &quot;seeking out truth&quot; implies a character it's going to be more accpeted in the Technocracy, because that's bullshit.</div> </div> </div> </div>True, but this character may encounter some problems if he\u2019s super vocal about deriving his paradigm from Plato... oh, wait. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3148-zennis\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3148_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3148\" data-vbnamecard=\"3148\">Zennis</a> said the character was more into Aristotle than Plato. That should be fine from a Technocratic perspective.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-23T08:13:58-08:00","id":1429625,"title":"","content":"<br /> In philosophy you can always take some and leave some. Surely belief in reincarnation and souls would be cringey for a Technocrat, but there's a lot of stuff in Plato that's much less objectionable.<br /> <br /> Like, the Republic could easily be a Technocratic dream utopia, with the enlightened gold people being the chosen to rule because they've mastered the fundamental sciences. It could be interesting to see a NWO agent with that mindset","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1683,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","user":"Aleph","date":". 12-23-2020, 11:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-23T11:40:42-08:00","id":1429647,"title":"","content":"Hmmm. Maybe. Like replace the philosopher-monarch in the Republic with a scientist-monarch?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25665,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/","user":"Guest","date":". 12-23-2020, 02:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-23T11:41:35-08:00","id":1429648,"title":"","content":"(Deleted; double post)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/defau